flowchart TD
 A[Citizen submits report] --> B[Submitted]
 B --> C[Admin review]
 C --> D[Under review]
 D --> E[Admin assigns active staff]
 E --> F[Assigned]
 F --> G[Assigned staff starts response]
 G --> H[In progress]
 H --> I[Resolved]
 I --> J[Closed]
 I --> H
 B -.-> K[Transactional audit capture]
 E -.-> K
 H -.-> K
 K --> L[Durable anchoring]
 L --> M[Integrity verification]
 M --> N{Evidence matches?}
 N -->|Yes| O[Verified]
 N -->|Mismatch or missing| P[Finding and notification]
 N -->|Infrastructure unavailable| Q[Warning and retry]
 P --> R[Investigation with justification]
 R --> K
